WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER

This file lists direct dependencies as declared in this repository's own manifests.
It does not enumerate the full transitive dependency tree (the packages your direct
dependencies themselves depend on), and it does not cover build-time-only tooling
that never ships in a built app (test frameworks, linters, the TypeScript compiler's
own runtime). A full software bill of materials would need a generated report from
each ecosystem's own tooling (for example `npm ls` plus each package's declared
license, or a NuGet license-audit tool), which this file is not a substitute for.

If you find an inaccuracy here, or a bundled asset that is missing entirely, please
open an issue.
